Third-party material
--------------------
* proprietary/ contains stock firmware extracted from the Infinix X663
  vendor partition.  It is not committed to Git and is not licensed under
  Apache-2.0; it remains subject to Infinix/Transsion terms.  It is included
  only for local device bring-up and must not be redistributed without
  permission.
* The vendor SELinux CIL, context files, precompiled policy, HAL binaries,
  libraries and configuration files under proprietary/ are part of that
  stock firmware.

This repository intentionally does not contain or use a `vendor.img`.  The
vendor partition is built from the source tree and the extracted blobs.
